Usage: monokl-old search [OPTIONS] <QUERY> [PATH]

Arguments:
  <QUERY>  The query: words, "quoted phrases", `+required`, `-excluded` and `regex:pattern` terms
  [PATH]   The directory to search [default: .]

Options:
      --exact                      Treats the whole query as one literal term
      --tests                      Searches test files too
      --no-ignore                  Searches hidden files and files that .gitignore or .ignore (in
                                   the search path or its parents) would exclude
      --language <LANGUAGE>        Searches only this language [possible values: typescript,
                                   javascript, rust, python]
      --max-results <MAX_RESULTS>  The most results to print [default: 50]
      --max-tokens <MAX_TOKENS>    The most estimated tokens (one per three bytes) across the
                                   printed rows [default: 20000]
      --max-bytes <MAX_BYTES>      The most bytes across the printed rows [default: 2097152]
  -h, --help                       Print help

